{"spoiler":false,"text":"She currently lives in Tomoe Dorm, a dormitory run by the Tomoe Shrine of which her relative is the head priest."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31862"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/34/34a21a235f1375c00bca9a64c7a9dadbcc8df4526037b43faf3e6ed9e0b8157f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bc/bc81d51e9ada073c93e54589633804548d7cca98a34f387cc41d38982f37d820.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"睦月 とおか","creatorId":"vndb:s28998","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28998","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28998","name":"睦月 とおか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:63029","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31864","characterName":"弥生 花梨","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31864"},"originalCharacterName":"弥生 花梨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"303"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cute, energetic girl who aspires to be an idol. Girlish and helplessly tsundere, she comes from a family of sake brewers from Akita Prefecture."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In her younger days she was a loose cannon that would even give the toughest boys a run for their money, but after seeing legendary idol Kiraboshi Mizuki live in concert in preschool, she decided to start acting."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After entering middle school she came to Tokyo, and with the help of some relatives, was able to move into Tomoe Dorm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31864"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c1/c1ca25e79539e8f38bbe1a46c4ed85fcc3c5cfe7a87e1870fe72683114df4e2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f79578a4ea71463b438aa13ca3e3cd9aead66c2f5460ba85d840658c994d65b6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加澄 もも","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:63030","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31866","characterName":"葉月 葵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31866"},"originalCharacterName":"葉月 葵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"819"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Curious and quick to make friends, Aoi always sticks her nose into other people's business and has a tendency to get stuck with the short stick."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the granddaughter of Hazuki Sougen, the master of the karate dojo Seibukan. Loves cooking and cleaning, and handles all the housework of Tomoe dorm by herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's kind, and dislikes conflict."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she's self-conscious of her boyish tendencies, she hasn't tried to address her slightly rough speaking style."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31866"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https: